# A truncated save-block frame (header + a few payload bytes, as when a
# byte is lost mid-dump or the core abandons a block) must not trap the
# parser for the whole 1 s link-resync window: joy frames arrive every
# 40 ms here, under the 50 ms mid-frame gap, so only the frame-age cap
# frees the parser. The menu combo 300 ms after the injection must work
# (before the fix it lands inside the open 515-byte frame and is eaten).
expect-screen "TangCore"
press down
press down
press down
press down
press b
expect-screen "cgame.sms"
press down
press a
expect-overlay off
expect-core smstang
wait 300ms
log-mark
inject-rx aa02030a0010000102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f
pad-churn raw
wait 300ms
hold select+start+l 400ms
pad-churn off
expect-screen "Close game"
expect-core smstang
expect-overlay on
expect-no-log "fpga silent"
